 },
 {
  "id": "1.1._114_",
  "field": "eng",
  "new": "These forty chapters (चत्वारिंशत्/forty) are the Sūtra section (सूत्रं/aphorism section); the Śārīra section (शारीरम्/anatomy section) is stated next.",
  "kind": "translation",
  "note": "Hindi and English disagreed"
 },
 {
  "id": "1.1._117_",
  "field": "hindi",
  "new": "दूत (दूतादि अरिष्ट) सहित ये बारह अध्याय शारीर स्थान के हैं; इसके बाद सब रोगों का निदान (निदान स्थान) है ॥",
  "kind": "gloss",
  "note": "12 chapters belong to Śārīra (list in rows 115-116), not Nidāna; Nidāna is the 16 chapters of rows 118-120"
 },
 {
  "id": "1.1._117_",
  "field": "eng",
  "new": "Twelve chapters including the one on messengers (द्वादश अध्याया/twelve chapters) complete the Śārīra section; then comes the diagnosis of all diseases (निदानं सार्वरोगिकं/Nidāna section).",
